  "info": {
    "description": "Generated from the app's ABI (its `calimero:abi` section). Every request and answer travels inside the node's sealed channel, after the client has verified the node's attestation: use mero-js or calimero-client-py as the transport (the typed clients `mero-app-build codegen` writes do), not plain HTTP. `POST /apps/{app}/methods/{name}` runs exactly as `POST /apps/{app}/intents` (a call) or `POST /apps/{app}/views` (a view) with the same `method`: the same authentication, gating, passkey step-up and limits. Errors are `{ error, message, details }`.",
